{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Click Me Harder</strong> is the ultimate anime girl clicker experience you didn\u2019t know you needed \u2014 and probably shouldn\u2019t admit to playing. Start with one lonely anime girl and a dream: to click her. Hard. For money.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click earns cash. Upgrade your clicks, automate your earnings with idle anime assistants, and snowball your empire into a full-blown waifu industrial complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.poster.avif?t=1756005884\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/43c2ba8b66932e76bc1081360c448bdf.webm?t=1756005884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918190/extras/1ac71efe7016cba1b1eec89538294fa2.avif?t=1756005884\" width=200 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click anime girls. Repeatedly. For profit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch numbers get bigger than your love for anime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a waifu workforce \u2014 Upgrade girls to get more money and points.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Idle income so you can \u201cgo outside\u201d and still earn money (you won\u2019t).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Questionable moral decisions wrapped in cute packaging.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Items to collect and trade!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not just clicking. You\u2019re ascending.<br>Wishlist now and prepare to say: <strong>\